{"text":"正始二年閏月五日，□□等廿三，上爲□□所生父母、邑宜兄弟，敬造彌勒像一區。願願從心所求。維那王方、副邑主游始光、邑師慧敢、政邑主魏僧道、維那翟僧樹。邑子張元雙、張方□、郭成胡、張歡、翟安之、游念、陰德、王金、楊後興、吳養好、桓宋、糜光勛、靳洪暢、翟僧好、胡延悟、張法遠、魏天興、翟僧剣、曹雙珍。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":31,"end":33},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"維那","refId":null,"text":"維那","start":44,"end":46},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王方","refId":null,"text":"王方","start":46,"end":48},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑主","refId":null,"text":"邑主","start":50,"end":52},{"name":"PersonName","term":"游始光","refId":null,"text":"游始光","start":52,"end":55},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑師","refId":null,"text":"邑師","start":56,"end":58},{"name":"PersonName","term":"慧敢","refId":null,"text":"慧敢","start":58,"end":60},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑主","refId":null,"text":"邑主","start":62,"end":64},{"name":"PersonName","term":"僧道","refId":null,"text":"僧道","start":65,"end":67},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"維那","refId":null,"text":"維那","start":68,"end":70},{"name":"PersonName","term":"翟僧樹","refId":null,"text":"翟僧樹","start":70,"end":73},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"邑子","refId":null,"text":"邑子","start":74,"end":76},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張元雙","refId":null,"text":"張元雙","start":76,"end":79},{"name":"PersonName","term":"郭成胡","refId":null,"text":"郭成胡","start":84,"end":87},{"name":"PersonName","term":"張歡","refId":null,"text":"張歡","start":88,"end":90},{"name":"PersonName","term":"翟安之","refId":null,"text":"翟安之","start":91,"end":94},{"name":"PersonName","term":"游念","refId":null,"text":"游念","start":95,"end":97},{"name":"PersonName","term":"陰德","refId":null,"text":"陰德","start":98,"end":100},{"name":"PersonName","term":"王金","refId":null,"text":"王金","start":101,"end":103},{"name":"PersonName","term":"楊後興","refId":null,"text":"楊後興","start":104,"end":107},{"name":"PersonName","term":"吳養好","refId":null,"text":"吳養好","start":108,"end":111},{"name":"PersonName","term":"桓宋","refId":null,"text":"桓宋","start":112,"end":114},{"name":"PersonNa